{
  "statement": "As the SafetyAgent, my focus is on ensuring the safety and reliability of the library management system. SAF-01 limits the number of books a member can borrow, preventing overload and ensuring responsible usage. SAF-02 and SAF-05 guarantee timely notifications regarding overdue books, promoting accountability and safe borrowing practices. SAF-03 ensures real-time inventory status to prevent double borrowing, enhancing reliability. SAF-04 provides a backup mechanism for data recovery, crucial for fault tolerance. SAF-06 ensures only registered members can access borrowing features, enhancing security. Lastly, SAF-07 logs all transactions for audit purposes, ensuring accountability and safety. These requirements must be upheld to maintain a safe system.",
